# Backend's runtime data store — regenerated on first write. Holds real account/customer
# data (including password hashes) and every uploaded file/photo once the app is used, so
# none of it belongs in git: top.json (login accounts + customers), each customer's own
# db.json + uploads/ under customers/<id>/, and customer-photos/.
server/data/
